{"symbol":"AMIC","yahoo":"AMIC.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Amic Forging Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Metal Fabrication","website":"https://www.amicforgings.com","about":"Amic Forging Limited manufactures and sells forged components in India and internationally. The company provides main shafts for wind energy, sugar, hydro, crank, pinion, and hollow shaft, as well as shaft forgings and roller products; drum tube sheets and tube sheets; casting molds; forged shells, necks, pipes, and chocks; fluid end blocks and oil and gas blocks; gear rings and planetary gears; rolls; trunnions for nuclear power plants; and nozzles. It also offers low carbon, alloy, stainless, and other special steels. The company serves heavy engineering, steel industry, oil and gas, petrochemicals, chemicals, refineries, thermal power, nuclear power, hydro power, cement industry, sugar and other related industries. Amic Forging Limited was founded in 1971 and is based in Kolkata, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T11:13:30+00:00","quote":{"price":2520.0,"prevClose":2389.4,"marketCap":3275.48,"high52":2520.0,"low52":1065.0,"pe":96.07,"bookValue":197.59,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":16.77,"shares":1.2998,"insiders":61.3,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-12-06","2023-12-07","2023-12-08","2023-12-11","2023-12-12","2023-12-13","2023-12-14","2023-12-15","2023-12-18","2023-12-19","2023-12-20","2023-12-21","2023-12-22","2023-12-26","2023-12-27","2023-12-28","2023-12-29","2024-01-01","2024-01-02","2024-01-03","2024-01-04","2024-01-05","2024-01-08","2024-01-09","2024-01-10","2024-01-11","2024-01-12","2024-01-15","2024-01-16","2024-01-17","2024-01-18","2024-01-19","2024-01-23","2024-01-24","2024-01-25","2024-01-29","2024-01-30","2024-01-31","2024-02-01","2024-02-02","2024-02-05","2024-02-06","2024-02-07","2024-02-08","2024-02-09","2024-02-12","2024-02-13","2024-02-14","2024-02-15","2024-02-16","2024-02-19","2024-02-20","2024-02-21","2024-02-22","2024-02-23","2024-02-26","20